# loop.md — recurring prompts for this repo

Copy to the repo root as `loop.md`. Run with `/loop <interval> <prompt>`; it re-runs while the session is open, `Esc` stops it.

## Babysit my open PR — `/loop 15m`
Check my open PR/MR on the current branch: new review comments → address the clear ones and reply; CI red → run /ci-triage and fix if it is a regression in my diff; merge conflict → report, do not resolve without asking. Stop when CI is green and no unresolved comments remain.

## Watch the deploy — `/loop 5m`
Check the latest deploy of <service> to <env>: status, health endpoint <url>, error rate in logs. Report only on change. Stop when it is healthy for two consecutive checks or failed.

## Morning maintenance — `/loop 24h`
Pull the base branch, run the test suite, list PRs waiting on me, and flag dependency or security advisories. Summarize in five lines.
